**Scope note on `remark.pdf`.** Chaining unitary theta lifts with an Iwasawa tower and weakened Vandiver (`H¹` of cyclotomic towers) points to **RH + Dirichlet GRH**, leaving **Dedekind/Hecke GRH** (and automorphic $\mathrm{GL}_n$) as the deferred "ERH" `[speculative]`. In this repo, `ERH` means *Dirichlet GRH mod $N$* in `detGRH`/`zroute` (following Miller/Bach) `[proved]`, vs. *Dedekind/Hecke GRH* in `nested`/`escapeR2` (following dBPW) `[proved]`. Non-explicit $\operatorname{Re}(\rho)=1/2$ suffices for explicit Bach and Lagarias–Odlyzko bounds via Weil's explicit formula `[KNOWN]`.

---

### Q1. Inventory of Repo Changes Under RH / GRH

- **RH for $\zeta(s)$ alone (included in a–c):**
  - **Genus-2 HECM (`Theorem R`, `Cors R1–R2`, [genus2rh_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/genus2rh_results.md#L322-L391) §0, §4, §7.1):** Las Vegas factoring in $L_p[1/2, c+o(1)](\log N)^{5+o(1)}$ becomes unconditional at $c = 3/\sqrt{2}$ (via Soundararajan 2010 + Shiu) `[proved]`, or $c = 2$ *still conditional* on Younis's unrefereed `arXiv:2409.05761v1` Thm 1.3 (plus internal LPP-III accounting) `[proved]`. Beats LP92 $L_N[1/2,1]$ only when $p \le N^\beta$, $\beta < 1/4$ `[proved]`.
  - **SNFS cofactor recognition `(O2)` ([snfsrig_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/snfsrig_results.md#L60-L67) §0, §1.5, §4):** Discharged via `genus2rh` ($\beta=1/2 \Rightarrow \alpha \ge 1/3$) `[proved]`. *Remains conditional:* `(O1)` (`Hyp RT`, pointwise smooth supply on fixed Kummer forms) and multi-field LV6 bookkeeping.

- **(a) GRH for Dirichlet $L$-functions (mod $N$):**
  - **Z-route reductions (`Prop Z`, `Prop EQ`, `Prop PIN`, `Theorem DZ`, `Prop EQ-dom`):** [detGRH_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/detGRH_results.md#L312-L346) §4, [zroute_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/zroute_results.md#L211-L220) §2 & [zroute_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/zroute_results.md#L401-L420) §5.1, [dsr_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/dsr_results.md#L385-L392) §5 become unconditional reductions `[proved]`. *Remains conditional:* **`Hypothesis DSR_α`** (deterministic smooth supply; no internal chain needed at degree 1), or **`PIN`** for seedless NFS (`zroute` §3.2).
  - **Existence, walks, Fourier barriers, IW derandomisation (`Prop GX`, `Prop RW`, `Prop AA`, `Thm FN(ii)`, `Prop IWD`):** [zroute_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/zroute_results.md#L423-L434) §5.1 and [dsr_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/dsr_results.md#L107-L229) §2, [dsr_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/dsr_results.md#L304-L310) §3 become unconditional — smooth representatives $\le N^{2+\varepsilon}$ exist, randomized JMV walks hit in $L[1/2]$, Bach certificates fail on $S_{\text{Gauss}}$ ($\|1_{S_{\text{Gauss}}}\|_A' \ge N^{1/4-o(1)}$), and **IW circuit hardness alone** implies deterministic $L[1/2]$ factoring (`Prop IWD`) `[proved]`. *Remains conditional:* IW lower bounds / `DSR`.
  - **Other reductions & barriers:**
    - `Prop ZA` ([zroute_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/zroute_results.md#L275-L297) §3.1): character-free Las Vegas $L[1/2]$ / $L[2/5]$; *still requires* the internal `Theorem A`/`U` chain `[proved]`.
    - `Schnorr CVP Lemma LA` ([schnorrcvp_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/schnorrcvp_results.md#L83-L85) §0, §2): odd-index lattice basis $\Rightarrow$ factor becomes unconditional `[proved]`; `Thm H` *still needs* heuristic `H_S, H_LA` + near-exact CVP oracle `[heuristic]`.
    - S-unit `Prop DW` / collision asymptotics / `Prop AB′` / `navigate Props SQ(b), CF(iii)` ([abcsunit_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/abcsunit_results.md#L82-L85) §0; [nonexact_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/nonexact_results.md#L235-L245) §2; [navigate_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/navigate_results.md#L124-L125) §2.5): unconditional `[proved]`; constructive solvers remain DL-hard.
    - Equivalences made unconditional: deterministic $\varphi,\lambda \Rightarrow \mathsf{FACT}$ (Miller 1976 `[KNOWN]`, [nonsmooth_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/nonsmooth_results.md#L87-L88)), multi-twist `#E(Z/N)` & CM quartic traces ([ecount_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/ecount_results.md#L128) §1; [tracedata_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/tracedata_results.md#L94) §2.5), 1-call prime-exponent successor ([factorbits_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/factorbits_results.md#L128) §1), QR $\le_R$ ambiguous form ([genusleak_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/genusleak_results.md#L159) §2) `[proved]`.
    - Model *barriers* made unconditional: `selfred Theorem L` ($N \bmod m$ flat for $m \le X^{1-\eta}$, [selfred_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/selfred_results.md#L380-L388) §4) and `leakmap PT-J1(b)` (Jacobi of pure values, [leakmap_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/leakmap_results.md#L430-L452) §3) `[proved]`; `nativeana LIN′`/semiprime `LIN` remain unwritten sketches ([nativeana_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/nativeana_results.md#L397-L425) §4) `[heuristic]`.

- **(b) GRH for Dedekind $\zeta_K$ / Hecke $L$-functions:**
  - **Growing-degree characters (`Lemma X_ERH`, [nested_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/nested_results.md#L426-L446) §7):** Unconditional (via Dedekind $\zeta_{K(\sqrt{h})}$), replacing factorial-bit primes and norm-parity columns in `Theorem U-MF` ([mfU_theorem.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/mfU_theorem.md#L624-L660) §8.4) and removing the $C_\chi\delta$ constant in `Theorem NR`/`NR-AA` ([almostall13_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/almostall13_results.md#L454-L465) §3.3) `[proved]`. `Theorem NR` *still requires* **`Hyp AD`** + `Hyp LV6′` + internal chain `[proved]`.
  - **Class-group / Arakelov sampling (`dBPW`, Hafner–McCurley, `Prop SQ`):** Unconditional via Hecke GRH ([nested_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/nested_results.md#L53-L69) §1–§2; [escapeR2_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/escapeR2_results.md#L264-L280) §2; [genusleak_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/genusleak_results.md#L85-L140) §1–§2) `[KNOWN]`, but `Theorem AF` caps dBPW at $L[1/2]$ `[proved]` (`escapeR2 Theorem NR-q` still needs `Hyp T_q`). Dense-root filter `Prop CS` ([prepread_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/prepread_results.md#L317-L330) §3.2) becomes unconditional `[proved]`.

- **(c) GRH for automorphic $L$-functions ($\mathrm{GL}_2/\mathrm{GL}_n$):**
  - **Nothing in the repo's factoring chains changes** `[proved]`. Unary-level $a_f(p)$ algorithms (Bruin 2011; [nativemod_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/nativemod_results.md#L127-L130) §1; [cuspcoef_results.md](file:///Volumes/git/factoring-connection/notes/cuspcoef_results.md#L379-L392) §5) use Dirichlet/Hecke GRH and still need factored input; $\mathrm{Sym}^m$ GRH supplies no determinant (`p`) for single $a_f(N)$ `[proved]`.

